  "description": "Pins protocol::encode_chats_blob_raw + decode_chats_blob (MYJ1) + aad_chats_blob. Inner plaintext is the shipped writer's turn-list payload JSON ({turns, title_derived_from}); the codec treats it as opaque bytes. AAD binds conversation_id (16 B) + account_number_hash (16 B) under role 'chats-blob' (55 B total), so one KEK serves every conversation file. KEK = DeriveSubkey(root,'chats-key'). Reference impl: protocol/src/chats_blob.rs.",
